    "title": "Dorchester Cemetery Plans To Build Housing On Property - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago BOSTON (WBZ NewsRadio) — A cemetery in Boston's Dorchester neighborhood is opening its gates to new occupants of the living variety. The city's Zoning Board of Appeals has approved plans to build three two-family condos on land at the intersection of Milton Street and Granite Avenue. Cedar Grove Cemetery owns the land but can't use it for burials because of ledge rock. Read full article",
